<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 695 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 695 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural volume totaled 695 contracts versus 222 contracts traded overnight Thursday.</p>
<p>There were 15 wheat, 470 corn, 159 soybean, 13 soymeal, 36 corn call and two corn puts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was unchanged to 1-1/4 cents higher, corn steady to 1/2 cent higher and soybeans 3/4 to 1-3/4 cents higher.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
